$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM The stereoselective synthesis of (Z)-HFC=CFZnI and stereospecific
preparation of (E)-1,2-difluorostyrenes from (Z)-HFC=CFZnI via an unusual
Pd(PPh3)4-Cu(I)Br co-catalysis approach or (Z)-HFC=CFSnBu3
