8.4 Hz), 7.32 (d, 2H, J = 8.4 Hz), and 7.67 (s, 1H); 13C NMR (CDCl3, 150
MHz) δ 42.1, 48.4, 52.7, 54.3, 55.4, 74.4, 100.5, 102.1, 107.7, 108.9,
113.9, 121.6, 128.6, 130.7, 133.4, 134.7, 139.4, 147.9, 151.5, 158.8,
