$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2,6-Bis(pentafluorophenyl)-1,5-dioctyloxy-9,10-anthraquinone (14) A
solution of iodopentafluorobenzene (0.262 g, 0.89 mmol) in anhyd THF (3
ml) was slowly added dropwise to a refluxing suspension of Mg turnings
(0.026 g, 1.07 mmol) in anhyd THF (1.5 mL) under N2. The refluxing
mixture was stirred for 2 h until the complete disappearance of
iodopentafluorobenzene. Then, it was cooled to r.t. under N2, and
anhydrous CuBr (0.256 g, 1.8 mmol) was added. The resulting brown
suspension was stirred at r.t. for 1 h, then anhyd dioxane (l.5 ml) was
added and the mixture stirred at r.t. for 1 h. A solution of the dihalide
1 (0.158 g, 0.22 mmol) in anhyd toluene (10 ml) was introduced using a
syringe at r.t. under N2, and the resulting suspension was stirred at 90
°C for 24 h. After cooling to r.t., the mixture was diluted with Et2O (10
mL) and filtered to remove inorganic salts and insoluble by-products. The
organic solution was dried (Na2SO4) and the solvent distilled at reduced
pressure. The purification of the crude product was carried out by column
chromatography over silica gel using PE-CH2Cl2 (6:4) as the eluent to
give a product. Pale yellow solid, yield 0.143 g, 81%. mp 118- 122 °C
(EtOH). FTIR (KBr): 2960, 2930, 2860, 1680, 1520, 1490, 1480, 1290, 1260,
1230, 1070, 986, 827, 800 cm-1. 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 0.80 (t, J =
6.7 Hz, 6 H), 1.16- 1.30 (m, 16 H), 1.36 (quint, J = 6.7 Hz, 4 H), 1.73
(quint, J = 6.7 Hz, 4 H), 4.03 (t, J = 6.7 Hz, 4 H), 7.15 (d, J = 8.7 Hz,
2 H), 7.37 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2 H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 14.0,
22.6, 25.7, 28.8, 29.1, 29.2, 31.8, 69.5, 115.0 (td, 2JC,F = 19 Hz, 3JC,F
= 5 Hz), 115.9, 116.7, 123.4, 137.0, 137.7, 137.7 (m, 1JC,F = 253 Hz),
140.5 (m, 1JC,F = 252 Hz), 143.9 (m, 1JC,F = 245 Hz), 159.0, 183.4. 19F
NMR (376 MHz, CDCl3): δ = -142.8 (dd, J = 22.3, 7.6 Hz, 2 F), -156.6 (t,
J= 22.3 Hz, 1 F), -163.4 (td, J= 22.3, 7.6 Hz, 2 F). Anal Calcd for
C42H38F10O4: C, 63.31; H, 4.81. Found: C, 63.30; H, 4.80.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of functionalized anthraquinones via coupling reactions of
2,6-diiodo-1,5-bis(octyloxy)-9,10-anthraquinone
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Babudri, Francesco; De Palma, Domenico; Farinola, Gianluca M.; Ragni,
Roberta; Naso, Francesco
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2008), (8), 1227-1232

