$DATUM Synthesis of 5-allyl-3-(3-allyl-4-methoxy-phenyl)-2-benzyloxy-pridine
(10) in one pot. A mixture of
2-benzyloxy-5-bromo-3-(3-iodo-4-methoxy-phenyl)-pyridine 3 (100 mg, 0.20
mmol) and tetrakis(triphenylphosphine)palladium (116.75 mg, 0.10 mmol),
allyltributyltin (0.23 mL, 0.72 mmol) in DMF (3 mL) was degassed by the
stream of argon for 5 min. And then, the reaction mixture was stirred for
2.5 h at 130 °C. The resulting mixture was concentrated in vacuo, and the
residue was purified by column chromatography (hexane/ethyl acetate =
50/1). Yield: (46 mg, 80%). 1H-NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.92 (d, 1H, J =
2.3 Hz), 7.27-7.44 (m, 8H), 6.88 (d, 1H, J = 8.3 Hz), 5.93-6.01 (m, 2H),
5.42 (s, 2H), 5.00-5.12 (m, 4H), 3.85 (s, 3H), 3.37 (dd, 4H, 20.7, J =
14.2 Hz). 13C-NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 158.9, 153.5, 145.4, 139.2, 137.5,
136.8, 136.6, 134.8, 133.4, 129.9, 129.2, 128.8, 128.5, 128.4(2), 127.7,
127.6(2), 127.5, 122.7, 116.6, 116.5, 67.9, 61.0, 36.4, 34.4. HRMS(EI):
m/z calcd for C25H25NO2 (M+H)+: 372.1964, obsd: 372.1958.
