$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General coupling procedure A mixture of bromothiophene derivatives
(0.5mmol), PdCl2(PPh5)2 (0.025mmol) and FcSnBu3 (0.55mmol) in 4ml of dry
DMF was stirred at 120-130 °C for the time given in the table. Then the
mixture was cooled to room temperature, 8ml water was added into it, then
extracted with ether, washed with saturated KF solution and water, dried
over MgSO4 and finally chromatographed on silica gel (eluant:
petroleum/acetone) to give desired products. 3a, yield 80%. 1H NMR δ
7.28-6.87(m, 3H), 4.79(m, 2H), 4.43(m, 2H), 4.27(s, 5H); IR: 3084, 1597,
1540, 1456, 1104, 1000, 507; MS m/z 268(M+, 72.5%).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Palladium-catalyzed Stille coupling for the preparation of ferrocenyl
thiophene derivatives
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
